<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>SNIPER RIFFLE</Major>
    <Description>CRAFT BY EXPERIENCE
heres another one brou
this script for awp/sniper riffle bolt action
its mechanism use 31 as u know 31 are the fastest way to quick change ur weapons
happy sniping brodii</Description>
